        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>z_fac</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Muliplies the triangle coordinates by the supplied factors and reorganises the triangles if their sense of rotation changes.</para>
<sect1 id="group___c_s_m_pglobal_functions_1arguments">
<title>Input Arguments</title><para>The scale factors for the x, y, and z axis are entered. A factor of<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>is to be entered if an axis shall not be scaled and a factor of -1. if an axis shall be inverted.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="group___c_s_m_pglobal_enums_1application">
<title>Application Examples</title><para>To scale an object for a new frame of reference. <linebreak/>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="group___c_s_m_pglobal_functions_1messages">
<title>Messages</title><para>Nothing is done if no objects are present. </para>
</sect1>
